  BossCallEventDescription: "\u201CHey dude, look, I just sent something over to
    ya; a little mishap over in LA. Nothing too big for ya, heh. It's just a little
    icky and I'm kind of squeamish so, if you could remove all the weird bits, you
    know.   Oh, and remember, our actions should be preeeetty undetectable in the
    final result. We just had some issues with that other guy and we were forced
    to uh\u2026. terminate him. haha.  Have this on my desk by Tuesday. (\u2026)
    Which is now. Do it now.\u201D "
  AudioClipDescription: 'Woman: Heeyyyy Girl!! So I''m a street photographer; can
